! Synthetic FullProf resolution file (invented numbers): a Lorentzian width and a constant rise term
!  Type of profile function: back-to-back exponentials * pseudo-Voigt
NPROF 9
!       Tof-min(us)    step      Tof-max(us)
TOFRG    2000 4.0 13000
!       Zero     Dtt1        Dtt2
ZD2TOF   1.0 3800.0 0.5
!     TOF-TWOTH of the bank
TWOTH    44.0
!       Sig-2     Sig-1     Sig-0
SIGMA    14.0 25.0 5.0
!       Gam-2     Gam-1     Gam-0
GAMMA    2.8 5.0 2.0
!          alph0       beta0       alph1       beta1
ALFBE    0.5 0.052 0.53 0.0049
END
